                    \\;\simeq\;
                    G \times_H \Gamma
                    \\,,
            %p
              makes it evident that tom Dieck’s condition
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:tomDieckLocalTrivalityHomomorphism"} (6)
              is satisfied for Lashof’s local model in that the following square is manifestly a
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback"} pullback
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
                      %mtable
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                            %mi G
                            %msub
                              %mo ×
                              %mi H
                            %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                            %mi S
