          %p
          #SufficientConditionForEquivariantEnhancementOfLocalTrivialization.num_remark
            %h6 Remark
            %p
              %strong (sufficient condition for plain local trivialization to have equivariant enhancement)
              Sufficient conditions for existence of plain local trivialization to imply a
              = succeed "-equivariant" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
