              the same statement appears as
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "#GuillouMayMerling17"} Guillou, May &amp; Merling 17, Thm. 3.11
              = succeed "\u2018s" do
                %a{:href => "#MurayamaShimakawa95"} Murayama-Shimakawa 95
              = succeed "." do
